# Premium UI/UX Rules

TrackNariño must look like a modern premium startup app.

Design inspiration:
- Uber Freight
- Tesla
- Notion
- Linear
- Stripe
- Google Maps
- Cabify Driver

UI Requirements:
- Minimalist interfaces
- Elegant cards
- Professional spacing
- Soft shadows
- Rounded corners
- Modern typography
- Smooth transitions
- Clean maps
- High-end dashboard feel

Color Palette:
- Dark graphite
- Deep green
- White
- Soft gray
- Emergency red for alerts

Avoid:
- Saturated colors
- Generic Flutter UI
- Crowded screens
- Inconsistent components
- Large blocks of text

Every screen must feel polished and intentional.
